~ fairy
if get_fact("choice.nail_kept")
	Fairy: Iron. Stay there. Not one step closer, unless you mean to give it up.
	- Hand it over
		$> remove_item("iron_nail")
		$> set_fact("choice.nail_kept", false)
		$> add_opinion("fairy", 1)
		$> add_favor("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Late. I owe you 1 for it, instead of 2.
	- Keep it
		$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
		## Ask again any time.
		Fairy: Then stay where you are. I can hear you thinking from here.
	=> END
if has_item("jar")
	Fairy: That jar. It is mine. Whatever is inside remembers me.
	- Give her the jar
		$> remove_item("jar")
		$> advance_quest("jar")
		$> set_fact("choice.jar", "fairy")
		$> add_favor("fairy", 1)
		$> add_opinion("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Mine, as I said. It will stop screaming soon. I owe you 1.
	- Open it here
		$> remove_item("jar")
		$> advance_quest("jar")
		$> set_fact("choice.jar", "freed")
		$> add_sanity(15)
		$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
		Fairy: You let it out. That was mine. I will remember the hands that did it, and I will find them again.
	- Not yet
		$> set_fact("choice.jar_kept")
		## She asks again while you carry the jar.
		Fairy: I can wait. I have waited longer than your kind has had names.
if is_quest_done("iron_nail")
	=> fairy_ledger
if get_quest_stage("iron_nail") == 1
	if has_item("iron_nail")
		Fairy: That is the nail. Hold it away from me. Will you hand it over?
		- Give the nail
			$> remove_item("iron_nail")
			$> advance_quest("iron_nail")
			$> add_opinion("fairy", 1)
			$> add_favor("fairy", 2)
			Fairy: The nail is gone. I owe you 2. Come to me when you want to spend them.
		- Keep it
			$> set_fact("choice.nail_kept")
			$> advance_quest("iron_nail")
			$> add_opinion("fairy", -2)
			## She still takes the nail later, for 1 favor.
			Fairy: Then keep it close. I will remember this.
	else
		Fairy: You carry no nail. Do not waste my time. You do not have much of yours left.
	=> END
if get_quest_stage("iron_nail") == 0
	Fairy: The nail is in a stump, left of the tree, far ahead. It will not come out without hate. You have plenty.
	=> END
if not get_level_flag("showcase.fairy_met")
	$> set_level_flag("showcase.fairy_met")
	% Fairy: A human. Lost, by the look of you.
	% Fairy: You have a very readable face. I have already read it twice.
	Fairy: Where did you come from?
	- I do not remember. [if get_sanity_zone() >= 2 /]
		$> add_opinion("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Honest. That will not last.
	- You know where. You sent me here. [if get_sanity_zone() < 2 /]
		$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
		$> add_sanity(-5)
		Fairy: I like that you think I did. It means some of me is already living in you.
	- Not telling.
		$> set_fact("choice.fairy_secret")
		Fairy: Keep it. Secrets here ferment. When it is ready, I will drink it.
Fairy: I would ask a favor. A small one. There is an iron nail in a stump. Pull it out for me.
- Deal
	$> advance_quest("iron_nail")
	$> set_level_flag("showcase.nail_wanted")
	$> add_opinion("fairy", 1)
	Fairy: Agreed. The stump is left of the tree. The nail will not come out without hate.
- No
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Fairy: Then you get nothing. Ask again later, and the offer will be worse.
=> END


~ fairy_ledger
if get_opinion("fairy") < 0
	Fairy: You. I give less to those I do not like. I decide what less means.
Fairy: By my count I owe you {{get_favor("fairy")}}, and you owe me {{get_debt("fairy")}}.
Fairy: I keep my count somewhere warm, where you cannot see it.
- A truth. One favor. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 1 /]
	$> add_favor("fairy", -1)
	## Under sanity 50 touching the shape is safe.
	Fairy: The shape past the red line is not there when your mind is going. It gets thinner as you do.
## Pays 15 sanity, 10 when her opinion is under 0.
- Calm. One favor. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 1 /]
	$> add_favor("fairy", -1)
	if get_opinion("fairy") < 0
		$> add_sanity(10)
		Fairy: Calm. The smallest I had. You never said which size.
	else
		$> add_sanity(15)
		Fairy: Calm, as agreed. Do not get used to it.
## Up to 3 debts. She takes 25 sanity each at the gate.
- Calm now. Pay later. [if get_debt("fairy") < 3 /]
	$> add_debt("fairy", 1)
	$> add_sanity(20)
	Fairy: Calm, now. You will pay at the gate.
	Fairy: I take it from the part of you that is still deciding whether to trust me. That part is smaller every time.
- Call it even. One favor for one debt. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 1 and get_debt("fairy") >= 1 /]
	$> add_favor("fairy", -1)
	$> add_debt("fairy", -1)
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	Fairy: One for one. How dull. I was looking forward to collecting.
## Pays a debt first, else she owes 1. Red pile never runs out.
- Take this hate. [if has_item("aspect_of_hate") /]
	$> remove_item("aspect_of_hate")
	if get_debt("fairy") > 0
		$> add_debt("fairy", -1)
		Fairy: Hate. I will eat it. One debt is gone. It tastes like you.
	else
		$> add_favor("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Hate. I will eat it. I owe you 1 more. Bring more. You make so much of it.
## Right answer pays once. Wrong ones cost sanity and can be retried.
- Ask me something. [if get_sanity_zone() < 2 and get_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "") != "right" /]
	Fairy: Answer me, then. What holds the gate shut?
	- Roots
		$> set_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "right")
		$> add_favor("fairy", 1)
		Fairy: Correct. I hate that. I owe you 1 more.
	- Iron
		$> set_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "wrong")
		$> add_sanity(-15)
		Fairy: Incorrect. That one came out of you. You may ask again.
	- A key
		$> set_fact("choice.fairy_risk", "wrong")
		$> add_sanity(-15)
		Fairy: Incorrect. Keys are a human idea. You may ask again.
## Flavor, no effect.
- What happened to the last human?
	Fairy: They paid in full. I kept them for the interest.
- Leave
	Fairy: Go, then. I remember everything still open between us.
=> END

